cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PlantMetWiki BGC crosslinks: MIBiG and plantiSMASH to RDF"
version: bgc-v1.0
date-released: 2026-05-22
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/pathway-lod/map-to-rdf
url: https://plantmetwiki.bioinformatics.nl/
abstract: >
  RDF Turtle files linking biosynthetic gene cluster (BGC) data from
  MIBiG (curated) and plantiSMASH (predicted) to the PlantMetWiki /
  WikiPathways pathway knowledge graph, derived from PlantCyc 17.0.
  BGCs are typed as pmw:BiosyntheticGeneCluster and connected to pathway
  genes via RO:0000051 (has_part). For Arabidopsis thaliana, direct
  SPARQL joins are enabled through shared identifiers.org/tair.name/ IRIs.
